TITLE Calcite kinetics reacting with acidic Cu-Ba solution at 200C
SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2
    pe        4
    redox     pe
    units     mmol/kgw
    Cu        10
    Ba        5
    -water    1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0     1
        -m      1
        -parms  1.0  1.0
        -steps  10 100*10
        -cvode  true
        -tol    1e-10
END
